# 意图路由

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[User message] --> R[risk_gate]
    R -->|high risk| S[safe_response]
    R -->|safe| I[intent_router]
    I -->|profile incomplete| C[clarification.requested + degraded]
    I -->|create_plan| P[planning graph]
    I -->|replan| P
    I -->|query_plan| Q[read-only plan summary]
    I -->|unsupported| F[template fallback]
```

`hint_intent` 只是前端提示。最终意图由服务端规则和模型共同判定并写入 `resolved_intent`。
